# Optional SAM2 segmentation backend
# SCRIPTED INSTALL ONLY - does NOT follow standard lockfile contract.
# Run `make compile` in this directory to generate pinned ml-sam2.txt
#
# IMPORTANT:
# SAM2 requires non-standard install semantics on some platforms:
# - May require --no-build-isolation for torch compatibility
# - May require pre-installed PyTorch matching the build environment
#
# DO NOT use: pip install -r requirements/ml-sam2.txt directly
# INSTEAD use: ./scripts/bootstrap/install_ml_stack.sh --profile sam2
#
# The bootstrap script handles platform-specific install logic including:
# - Detecting build failures and retrying with --no-build-isolation
# - Ensuring ml-core dependencies are installed first
# - Validating successful installation
#
# Capability contract:
# - This is an OPTIONAL layer. Absence downgrades segmentation to EfficientSAM.
# - This layer is SCRIPTED-ONLY (not a standard lockfile contract).
# - Install via: ./scripts/bootstrap/install_ml_stack.sh --profile core-cpu,sam2
#
# Licensing:
# - Meta Segment Anything 2 - check license for commercial use requirements.

# SAM2 - Meta Segment Anything 2 for advanced segmentation
